# Keep important files (explicitly NOT ignored)
# These files SHOULD be committed:
# - compilar.sh (build script)
# - requirements.txt (dependencies)
# - README.md (documentation)
# - assets/ (icons and images)
# - src/ (source code)
# - main.py (entry point)
